# Active Directory Home Lab

A fully functional Windows Server 2022 Active Directory environment built from scratch as a hands-on IAM engineering project. This lab simulates a real enterprise identity infrastructure — including organizational unit design, role-based access control, Group Policy enforcement, and automated user provisioning.

---

## Lab Architecture

| Component | Details |
|---|---|
| Hypervisor | VirtualBox (or VMware Workstation) |
| Domain Controller | Windows Server 2022 — `DC01.lab.local` |
| Client Machine | Windows 10/11 — `CLIENT01` |
| Network | Internal-only (`192.168.10.0/24`) |
| Domain | `lab.local` |

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│           lab.local domain          │
│                                     │
│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  │
│  │    DC01      │  │  CLIENT01   │  │
│  │ 192.168.10.1 │  │192.168.10.10│  │
│  │  AD DS, DNS  │  │  Win 10/11  │  │
│  └──────────────┘  └─────────────┘  │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

