## How to Replicate This Lab

1. Download [Windows Server 2022 Evaluation](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/evalcenter/evaluate-windows-server-2022) (free, 180-day trial)
2. Create two VMs in VirtualBox — one for the DC, one for the client
3. Set both VMs to use an **Internal Network** adapter (`LabNet`)
4. Assign a static IP to the DC (`192.168.10.1`) and point DNS to itself
5. Install the AD DS role and promote to Domain Controller
6. Join the client VM to `lab.local` using the DC's IP as DNS

Full step-by-step setup notes are in [`/docs/setup-guide.md`](./docs/setup-guide.md).

